rules.rule:
Use CSS variables for colors (defined in CODING_STANDARDS.md):

:root {
  --color-aws-dark: #232F3E;
  --color-aws-orange: #dc7600;  /* Accessible version */
  --color-text-primary: #374151;
  --color-bg-light: #F9FAFB;
  --color-border: #909296;
}

Responsive breakpoints:
- Mobile: < 768px
- Tablet: 768px - 1024px
- Desktop: > 1024px

Touch targets: 44px minimum (mobile)
